# Project Documentation Rules

## Structure
- `AGENTS.md` (root) — product spec: what Alt Fun is, parameters, fees, BounceTech interface
- `apps/*/AGENTS.md` and `packages/*/AGENTS.md` — scope-specific context
- `docs/contracts-scope.md` — smart contract functional requirements
- `docs/backend-scope.md` — API endpoints, WebSocket events, data indexing
- `docs/frontend-scope.md` — UI spec, page layouts, trade flows

Root `AGENTS.md` is the source of truth. When files conflict, root wins.

## Formatting
Never use bare `$` signs in markdown — always wrap dollar amounts in backticks.

## Terminology
| Use this | Not this |
|---|---|
| leverage boost | HYPE boost, LT gain, leverage appreciation |
| bonding curve | curve, bond |
| graduation | migrate, launch (when referring to threshold crossing) |
| seed buy | dev buy, initial buy |
| curve filled | progress, bonding |
| HyperSwap | DEX (when referring to specific post-grad venue) |
| LT (Leveraged Token) | leveraged token (always capitalise) |
